ications Antioxidant activity DPPH The free radical scavenging activity of TiO 2 -NP was measured using DPPH (1,1-diphenyl-2-picryl hydrazyl). In brief, a 0.1 mM solution of DPPH in ethanol was prepared. This solution (1 ml) was added to 3 ml of TiO 2 -NP in ethanol at different concentrations (1.95–1000 µg/ml). The mixtures were shaken and allowed to stand for 30 min before measuring absorbance at 517 nm using a spectrophotometer (UV-VIS milton roy). Ascorbic acid was used as a reference standard. The percentages of DPPH scavenging were calculated using the following formula 97 . 2 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
