ip angled at approximately 30 degrees. Keeping the pipette tip at an angle helped maintain a narrow scratch width, enabling imaging of both wound edges under a 10x objective lens 102 . The following equation calculated the rate of migration (RM): 4 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
